---
import type { CrossingRow, ReleaseRow } from '../../scripts/backtest/build';
import { fitLabel, waterfallView } from '../ui/backtest-waterfall';

interface Props {
  releases: readonly ReleaseRow[];
  crossings: readonly CrossingRow[];
}
const { releases, crossings } = Astro.props;
const { views, label } = waterfallView(releases, crossings);
---
<figure class="waterfall">
  <ul class="legend" aria-hidden="true">
    <li><svg width="14" height="14"><circle class="t50" cx="7" cy="7" r="5" /></svg>held 0.5</li>
    <li><svg width="14" height="14"><circle class="t70" cx="7" cy="7" r="5" /></svg>held 0.7</li>
    <li><svg width="14" height="14"><circle class="t90" cx="7" cy="7" r="5" /></svg>held 0.9</li>
    <li><svg width="14" height="14"><circle class="t70 open" cx="7" cy="7" r="4.5" /></svg>above from its first price</li>
    <li><svg width="14" height="14"><rect class="avail" x="3" y="3" width="8" height="8" transform="rotate(45 7 7)" /></svg>listed on OpenRouter</li>
    <li><svg width="18" height="14"><line class="zero" x1="9" y1="0" x2="9" y2="14" /></svg>first-party announcement</li>
  </ul>
  {views.map((v) => (
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${v.W} ${v.H}`} role="img" aria-label={label} class={`chart ${v.name}`}>
      {v.ticks.map((t) => (
        <g>
          <line class={t.h === 0 ? 'zero' : 'grid'} x1={v.x(t.h)} x2={v.x(t.h)} y1={v.top - 8} y2={v.H - v.bottom + 4} />
          <text class="tick" x={v.x(t.h)} y={v.H - v.bottom + 22} text-anchor="middle">{t.label}</text>
        </g>
      ))}
      <text class="axis-note" x={v.x(0)} y={v.top - 18} text-anchor="middle">ANNOUNCED</text>
      <text class="axis-note" x={v.left} y={v.top - 18}>{v.labelAbove ? 'EARLIER' : 'MARKET GOT THERE FIRST'}</text>
      <text class="axis-note" x={v.W - v.right} y={v.top - 18} text-anchor="end">AFTER</text>
      {v.plotted.map((p) => (
        <g>
          <text class="row-label" x={v.labelAbove ? v.left : v.left - 12} y={p.labelY} text-anchor={v.labelAbove ? 'start' : 'end'}>
            <title>{p.release.model}</title>
            {fitLabel(p.release.model, v.labelAbove ? v.W - v.left - v.right : v.left - 20)}
          </text>
          {p.bar && <line class="lead" x1={p.bar.x1} x2={p.bar.x2} y1={p.y} y2={p.y} />}
          {p.note && (
            <text class="row-note" x={v.left + 6} y={p.y + 5}>{p.note}</text>
          )}
          {p.marks.map((m) => (
            <circle class={`${m.cls}${m.open ? ' open' : ''}`} cx={m.cx} cy={p.y} r={m.open ? 4.5 : 5}>
              <title>{m.title}</title>
            </circle>
          ))}
          {p.available && (
            <rect class="avail" x={p.available.cx - 4.5} y={p.availY - 4.5} width="9" height="9" transform={`rotate(45 ${p.available.cx} ${p.availY})`}>
              <title>{p.available.title}</title>
            </rect>
          )}
        </g>
      ))}
    </svg>
  ))}
  <figcaption class="muted">
    Each row is one launch, in date order. Circles mark when the market price first reached 0.5, 0.7 and 0.9 and stayed there for two hours. They are read from the day market when there is one, otherwise from the tightest "released by" rung that resolved Yes and was due within two days of the launch. The time axis is compressed, linear within a few hours of the announcement and logarithmic beyond. OpenRouter availability is plotted separately because a listing is not a forecast.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .waterfall { margin: 0; }
  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: var(--fs-xs); color: var(--text); }
  .legend li { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .chart { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 1000px; height: auto; font-family: var(--font-mono); }
  .chart.narrow { display: none; max-width: 480px; }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .chart.wide { display: none; }
    .chart.narrow { display: block; }
  }
  .grid { stroke: var(--line); stroke-width: 1; }
  .zero { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1; opacity: 0.7; }
  .tick { fill: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
  .axis-note { fill: var(--muted); font-family: var(--font-head); font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
  .row-label { fill: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }
  .narrow .row-label, .narrow .row-note, .narrow .tick { font-size: 14px; }
  .row-note { fill: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
  .lead { stroke: var(--ink-2); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; opacity: 0.45; }
  circle { stroke: var(--paper); stroke-width: 2; }
  .t50 { fill: var(--line2); }
  .t70 { fill: var(--ink-2); }
  .t90 { fill: var(--ink); }
  circle.open { fill: var(--paper); }
  circle.t50.open { stroke: var(--line2); }
  circle.t70.open { stroke: var(--ink-2); }
  circle.t90.open { stroke: var(--ink); }
  .avail { fill: var(--accent); stroke: var(--paper); stroke-width: 2; }
  .chart circle:hover, .chart rect:hover { stroke: var(--ink); }
  figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: var(--fs-xs); max-width: 90ch; }
</style>
